('127.54.d.5.E',3,'Plants that do not get enough light often become:','["Darker green", "Short and thick", "Tall and spindly", "More fragrant"]'::jsonb,2,'Stretching toward light is called etiolation.','original'),
('127.54.d.5.E',4,'The three main nutrients in a fertilizer are:','["Calcium, iron, zinc", "Sulfur, boron, copper", "Carbon, hydrogen, oxygen", "Nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium"]'::jsonb,3,'N-P-K are the primary macronutrients.','original'),
