('127.54.d.6.F',3,'Before using power equipment, a worker should:','["Read the manual and wear safety gear", "Remove guards", "Skip instructions", "Share with a friend"]'::jsonb,0,'Safe use starts with training and protection.','original'),
('127.54.d.6.F',4,'A safe way to carry a shovel is:','["Hold it over your head", "Hold it at your side with the blade pointed down", "Run with it", "Swing it"]'::jsonb,1,'Control tools to avoid injuries.','original'),
('127.54.d.6.G',3,'Cleaning and oiling hand tools after use helps to:','["Dull the blades", "Reduce safety", "Prevent rust and extend tool life", "Add weight"]'::jsonb,2,'Maintenance keeps tools working.','original'),
('127.54.d.6.G',4,'Sharpening pruners makes cuts that are:','["More diseased", "Slower", "Jagged", "Cleaner and less damaging to plants"]'::jsonb,3,'Sharp blades make clean cuts.','original'),
('127.54.d.7.A',3,'A stem cutting is an example of:','["Asexual propagation", "Sexual propagation", "Germination", "Pollination"]'::jsonb,0,'Cuttings produce clones of the parent.','original'),
('127.54.d.7.A',4,'Layering and division are both:','["Pests", "Asexual methods", "Fertilizers", "Sexual methods"]'::jsonb,1,'They create new plants without seeds.','original'),
