('127.54.d.10.D',4,'Wholesale prices are usually:','["Unrelated to cost", "Lower than retail prices", "Higher than retail", "The same"]'::jsonb,1,'Retail adds a markup.','original'),
('127.54.d.10.E',3,'A marketing plan for a plant business includes:','["Nothing", "Only price", "Target customers, products, and promotion methods", "Only the logo"]'::jsonb,2,'Plans guide marketing.','original'),
('127.54.d.10.E',4,'Posting photos of plants on social media is an example of:','["Propagation", "Pruning", "Production", "Promotion"]'::jsonb,3,'Promotion tells customers about products.','original'),
('127.54.d.10.F',3,'A business budget lists expected:','["Income and expenses", "Weather", "Employee hobbies", "Plant names"]'::jsonb,0,'Budgets plan money use.','original'),
('127.54.d.10.F',4,'If expenses exceed income, the enterprise has:','["A balance", "A loss", "A bonus", "A profit"]'::jsonb,1,'Spending more than earning causes a loss.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.A',2,'A greenhouse student exploring careers might consider:','["Chef only", "Truck driver only", "Greenhouse manager or grower", "Referee only"]'::jsonb,2,'The greenhouse industry has many roles.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.A',3,'Which step helps a greenhouse student plan for a career?','["Ignoring education", "Skipping classes", "Waiting for a job", "Investigating certifications and degree programs"]'::jsonb,3,'Plans start with information.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.B',2,'Good communication in a greenhouse crew means:','["Reporting problems clearly to the supervisor", "Ignoring teammates", "Whispering", "Hiding issues"]'::jsonb,0,'Teamwork needs clear communication.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.B',3,'A critical-thinking response to a failing heater is to:','["Hope it fixes itself", "Identify the cause and notify the manager promptly", "Leave", "Turn it off"]'::jsonb,1,'Quick, informed action protects the crop.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.C',2,'Why wear gloves and eye protection when handling greenhouse chemicals?','["To look neat", "To save time", "To reduce exposure to harmful substances", "To keep plants clean"]'::jsonb,2,'PPE protects workers.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.C',3,'In a hot greenhouse, workers should:','["Avoid water", "Work without rest", "Skip breaks", "Drink water and take breaks to avoid heat illness"]'::jsonb,3,'Heat safety prevents illness.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.D',3,'Employers must follow laws about:','["Worker safety and fair pay", "Plant color", "Greenhouse paint", "Flower names"]'::jsonb,0,'Legal responsibilities protect employees.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.D',4,'Pesticide handlers in a greenhouse are covered by:','["Fashion rules", "Worker protection standards", "School rules", "Parking rules"]'::jsonb,1,'Standards require training and protection.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.E',2,'A good citizen in the greenhouse industry might:','["Pollute nearby water", "Ignore neighbors", "Donate plants to a community garden", "Dump waste"]'::jsonb,2,'Giving back builds community.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.E',3,'Responsible greenhouse water runoff management helps to:','["Pollute soil", "Break laws", "Waste water", "Protect nearby streams"]'::jsonb,3,'Controlling runoff protects the environment.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.F',3,'A pesticide applicator license is an example of:','["A required certification", "A free gift", "An elective grade", "A hobby"]'::jsonb,0,'Some jobs require licensing.','original'),
('127.55.d.1.F',4,'To become a greenhouse grower, a person might need:','["No training", "On-the-job training and sometimes a degree", "A pilot''s license", "Only luck"]'::jsonb,1,'Training varies by position.','original'),
('127.55.d.2.A',3,'A student grows poinsettias for sale and tracks results. This is an:','["Exam", "Awards banquet", "SAE in greenhouse production", "Club dues"]'::jsonb,2,'A planned, supervised hands-on project.','original'),
