('127.55.d.2.B',2,'Why record temperatures, watering, and costs in a greenhouse crop project?','["To evaluate results and improve", "To hide outcomes", "To waste time", "To lose data"]'::jsonb,0,'Records support decisions.','original'),
('127.55.d.2.B',3,'Which belongs in a greenhouse SAE record?','["Weather forecasts only", "Planting dates, inputs, and sales", "Sports scores", "Jokes"]'::jsonb,1,'Complete records track production.','original'),
('127.55.d.3.A',2,'Running for a chapter office is a way to:','["Avoid responsibility", "Skip meetings", "Gain leadership experience", "Quit"]'::jsonb,2,'Officers learn to lead.','original'),
