('127.55.d.3.C',3,'Updating experience records helps because it:','["Removes details", "Keeps them accurate for jobs and awards", "Makes them wrong", "Is a waste"]'::jsonb,1,'Current records show growth.','original'),
('127.55.d.4.A',3,'The development of glass-covered growing structures led to:','["No changes", "Fewer plants", "Year-round plant production", "Seasonal only"]'::jsonb,2,'Controlled structures extended seasons.','original'),
('127.55.d.4.A',4,'Early greenhouses known as orangeries were built to:','["House animals", "Store tools", "Grow corn", "Protect tender citrus plants in cold climates"]'::jsonb,3,'They sheltered fruit trees.','original'),
('127.55.d.4.B',3,'An emerging greenhouse technology is:','["LED grow lighting", "Candlelight", "Torches", "Sunlight only"]'::jsonb,0,'LEDs save energy and tune light.','original'),
('127.55.d.4.B',4,'Sensors that send data to a phone help growers by:','["Stopping growth", "Monitoring conditions remotely", "Increasing weeds", "Hiding data"]'::jsonb,1,'Remote monitoring improves control.','original'),
